common-passwords.txt

The passwords of 8 or more characters, lowercased, from "100k-most-used-passwords-NCSC.txt":
the UK National Cyber Security Centre's list of the 100,000 most used passwords found in
breaches (Have I Been Pwned), as distributed in SecLists
(https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists, Passwords/Common-Credentials).

